   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Venice AI · Video → video\n\n* **V2V** models edit, restyle, recast, extend or upscale an existing video: Wan 2.7 Edit, MiniMax H3 Max Recast, Grok Imagine V2V, HappyHorse Edit, Gemini Omni Flash Edit, Flux 3 Extend, Kling V3 Motion Control, Topaz Video Upscale.\n* Length follows the input video (*Auto*). The price depends on the input video, so check it with **price_only** first.\n* Input: MP4, MOV or WebM.\n\n[MODELS.md](https://github.com/Slartibart23/ComfyUI-Venice-AI-Nodes/blob/main/docs/MODELS.md)\n\n🇩🇪 Vorhandenes Video bearbeiten, umstylen oder verlängern. Preis vorher mit **price_only** prüfen.\n\n**API key:** put your Venice key into `Venice_AI_API.txt` in the ComfyUI folder (one line). Every run is billed to your Venice account.\n\n🇩🇪 Key in `Venice_AI_API.txt` im ComfyUI-Ordner. Jeder Lauf kostet Venice-Guthaben."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## Venice AI · Video → video\n\n* **V2V** models edit, restyle, recast, extend or upscale an existing video: Wan 2.7 Edit, MiniMax H3 Max Recast, Grok Imagine V2V, HappyHorse Edit, Gemini Omni Flash Edit, Flux 3 Extend, Kling V3 Motion Control, Topaz Video Upscale.\n* Length follows the input video (*Auto*). The price depends on the input video, so check it with **price_only** first.\n* Input: MP4, MOV or WebM.\n\n[MODELS.md](https://github.com/Slartibart23/ComfyUI-Venice-AI-Nodes/blob/main/docs/MODELS.md)\n\n🇩🇪 Vorhandenes Video bearbeiten, umstylen oder verlängern. Preis vorher mit **price_only** prüfen.\n\n**API key:** put your Venice key into `Venice_AI_API.txt` in the ComfyUI folder (one line). Every run is billed to your Venice account.\n\n🇩🇪 Key in `Venice_AI_API.txt` im ComfyUI-Ordner. Jeder Lauf kostet Venice-Guthaben."
   },
